# Project-authored noncontact communication fixture; SI units.
units si
atom_style sphere
atom_modify map array
boundary f f f
newton off
communicate single vel yes
processors * 1 1
region box block 0 1 0 1 0 1 units box
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 single 0.45 0.3 0.5 units box
create_atoms 1 single 0.55 0.7 0.5 units box
set group all diameter 0.01
set group all density 2500
group particle1 id 1
group particle2 id 2
velocity particle1 set 0.4 0 0 units box
velocity particle2 set -0.4 0 0 units box
fix matY all property/global youngsModulus peratomtype 1e7
fix matP all property/global poissonsRatio peratomtype 0.3
fix matR all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 1 0.5
fix matF all property/global coefficientFriction peratomtypepair 1 0.0
pair_style gran model hertz tangential history
pair_coeff * *
neighbor 0.01 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
fix integrate all nve/sphere
timestep 0.001
thermo 10
thermo_style custom step atoms time ke
thermo_modify lost error
variable demoTime equal step*dt
run 0
